Which will not help at all for TGA2.  TGA and TGA2 devices are not
compatable, and the XFree86 TGA servers (there are two of them
available) will not support a TGA2 card.  Even the TGA servers are
suboptimal since they do not support any of the acceleration features of
the card.

The FAQ at http://www.alphalinux.org has some useful pointers.  Go to
http://www.alphalinux.org/faq/FAQ-12.html  Most of the supported cards
ought to be available at fairly reasonable cost since they are somewhat
out of date, but are still serviceable.

