: What are the video cards that are compatible with this CPU MB combo..

the following PCI cards are IMHO known to work well with the older LX/UX
systems:

	- any S3/Trio/Virge
	- all ATI based on the Rage Pro chip
	- cards based on 3DLabs Permedia/2 (eg. Elsa GLoria Synergy)
	- any Matrox PCI (Millennium, Millennium II, Mystique, G100/200)

: I hear that TNT or TNT2 are not compatible....

That's right. All Nvidia-based cards do not work in alphas because of
incompatibilities in their video BIOS.

