Write the MILO diskette image to a diskette. Chose "Set up the system"->"Manage boot selection"->"Add a boot selection." Choose "Floppy Disk 0" foor the boot device. Enter "\linload.exe" (without the quotes) as os loader directory and name and "\" (no quotes) as os root directory. Use this entry to boot into MILO on the diskette. Then, follow the instructions in the manual.

